---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import AuthorSidebar from "../components/AuthorSidebar.astro";
import { AUTHOR } from "../consts";
---

<BaseLayout>
  <div class="page-layout">
    <AuthorSidebar />
    <main class="page-content">
      <h2>Founder. Software Engineer. AI Engineer.</h2>
      <p>
        Value creation is what drives me. I build things that ship, measure them
        by customer and commercial value, then move on to the next problem.
      </p>

      <h2>What I've Done</h2>
      <ul>
        <li class="metric-blue">
          <strong>AI normalization engine</strong> — Multi-pass LLM pipeline that
          processes unstructured supplier data at scale. Tiered model routing, Claude
          API, live in production. Built this while co-founding Etours Labs.
        </li>
        <li class="metric-green">
          <strong>$133k AUD</strong> — Revenue from a click-and-collect service I
          helped ship at Westfield during Covid. In a pandemic. No pressure.
        </li>
        <li class="metric-red">
          <strong>350k+ SKUs</strong> — Products live on the Westfield Direct marketplace
          I helped build and launch. Order management system processed $800k AUD/month.
          All on the same platform. All real.
        </li>
        <li class="metric-yellow">
          <strong>3 companies co-founded</strong> — Etours, STMI Mediatech, Smitcore.
          I apparently can't stop building things.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>About Me</h2>
      <p>
        Value creation is what drives me. Software and AI engineering are my
        tools. I use them because they let me create. Automation, AI systems,
        digital services. If you want the full story behind that, <a
          href="/about">read why I build</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        16 years shipping real products across e-commerce, marketplaces, booking
        engines, and automation systems for clients in Australia, New Zealand,
        and Southeast Asia. I recently finished a Masters in Entrepreneurship
        at the Asian Institute of Management, part of a longer <a
          href="/education">education journey</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        Everything I build is measured by customer and commercial value. I
        think like a founder because I am one. I don't just write code, I
        understand what's behind the ticket.
      </p>
      <p>
        I build through two companies, Etours Labs and Smitcore Software,
        where projects come to life as SaaS products or for-hire contract
        work.
      </p>

      <h2>Work With Me</h2>
      <p>
        I take on 1 to 4 week contracts in software and AI engineering.
        Python, Django, React, LLMs, document extraction, RAG pipelines. AU
        timezone friendly.
      </p>
      <p>
        Best fit is e-commerce, API integrations, AI tooling, and automation.
        Projects with real impact.
      </p>
      <p>I work with a small number of clients at a time. On purpose.</p>
      <p>
        If your problem is real and your timeline is tight, we'll get along
        fine. If you need someone to sit in meetings and look busy, I'm
        probably not your guy.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href={`mailto:${AUTHOR.email}`}>Email me</a> · <a
          href={AUTHOR.linkedin}>LinkedIn</a
        > ·
        <a href={AUTHOR.github}>GitHub</a>
      </p>
    </main>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
